  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h2>BSW Mode Manager (BswM)</h2><p class=\"lead\">Arbitrates mode requests and executes action lists to control system state transitions.</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00193\">BswM_BswMPartitionRestarted</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Restart Task if the partition containing the Bsw M has been restarted.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00049\">BswM_CanSM_CurrentState</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, Can SM_Bsw MCurrentStateType Current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Can SM to indicate its current state.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00047\">BswM_ComM_CurrentMode</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, ComM_ModeType RequestedMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Com M to indicate the current communication mode of a Com M channel.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00148\">BswM_ComM_CurrentPNCMode</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00036\">PNCHandleType</a> PNC, ComM_PncModeType Current PncMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function is called by Com M to indicate the current mode of the PNC.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00217\">BswM_ComM_InitiateReset</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function is called by Com M to signal a shutdown.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00158\">BswM_Dcm_ApplicationUpdated</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This function is called by the DCM in order to report an updated application.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00048\">BswM_Dcm_CommunicationMode_CurrentState</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"dcm.html#SWS_Dcm_00981\">Dcm_CommunicationModeType</a> RequestedMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by DCM to inform the Bsw M about the current state of the communication mode.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00119\">BswM_Deinit</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Deinitializes the BSW Mode Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_91003\">BswM_EcuM_CurrentState</a> (EcuM_StateType Current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called Ecu M to indicate the current ECU Operation Mode.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00131\">BswM_EcuM_CurrentWakeup</a> (EcuM_WakeupSourceType source, Ecu M_Wakeup <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"os.html#SWS_Os_00002\">StatusType</a> state);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Ecu M to indicate the current state of a wakeup source.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_91004\">BswM_EcuM_RequestedState</a> (EcuM_StateType State, Ecu M_Run <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"os.html#SWS_Os_00002\">StatusType</a> Current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Ecu M notify about current Status of the Run Request Protocol.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_91001\">BswM_EthIf_PortGroupLinkStateChg</a> (EthIf_SwitchPortGroupIdxType Port Group Idx, Eth Trcv_LinkStateType Port Group State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Eth If to indicate the link state change of a certain Ethernet switch port group.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00050\">BswM_EthSM_CurrentState</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, Eth SM_NetworkModeStateType Current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Eth SM to indicate its current state.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00051\">BswM_FrSM_CurrentState</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, FrSM_BswM_StateType Current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Fr SM to indicate its current state.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00003\">BswM_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* VersionInfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00002\">BswM_Init</a> (const BswM_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the BSW Mode Manager.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00165\">BswM_J1939DcmBroadcastStatus</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Network Mask);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API tells the Bsw M the desired communication status of the available networks.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00194\">BswM_J1939Nm_StateChangeNotification</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Node, Nm_StateType Nm State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Notification of current J1939Nm state after state changes.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00058\">BswM_LinSM_CurrentSchedule</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, LinIf_SchHandleType Current Schedule);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Lin SM to indicate the currently active schedule table for a specific LIN channel.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00052\">BswM_LinSM_CurrentState</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, LinSM_ModeType Current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Lin SM to indicate its current state.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00156\">BswM_LinTp_RequestMode</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, LinTp_Mode Lin Tp RequestedMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Lin TP to request a mode for the corresponding LIN channel.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00235\">BswM_Nm_CarWakeUpIndication</a> (NetworkHandleType Network);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Nm to indicate a Car Wakeup.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_91002\">BswM_Nm_StateChangeNotification</a> (NetworkHandleType Network, Nm_StateType current State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Notification of current Nm state after state changes.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00104\">BswM_NvM_CurrentBlockMode</a> (NvM_BlockIdType Block, NvM_RequestResultType Current BlockMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Nv M to indicate the current block mode of an Nv M block.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00152\">BswM_NvM_CurrentJobMode</a> (NvM_MultiBlockRequestType Multi Block Request, NvM_RequestResultType Current JobMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Nv M to inform the Bsw M about the current state of a multi block job.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00046\">BswM_RequestMode</a> (BswM_UserType requesting_user, BswM_ModeType requested_mode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Generic function call to request modes.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00204\">BswM_Sd_ClientServiceCurrentState</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Sd Client Service HandleId, Sd_Client Service CurrentStateType Current Client S tate);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Service Discovery to indicate current state of the Client Service (available/ down).</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00207\">BswM_Sd_ConsumedEventGroupCurrentState</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Sd Consumed Event Group HandleId, Sd_Consumed Event Group CurrentStateType Consumed Event Group State);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Service Discovery to indicate current status of the Consumed Eventgroup (available/ down).</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00210\">BswM_Sd_EventHandlerCurrentState</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> Sd Event Handler HandleId, Sd_Event Handler CurrentStateType Event Handler Status);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Service Discovery to indicate current status of the Event Handler (requested/ released).</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00157\">BswM_WdgM_RequestPartitionReset</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"os.html#SWS_Os_00772\">ApplicationType</a> Application);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by Wdg M to request a partition reset.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00053\">BswM_MainFunction</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Main function of the Bsw M</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <<<< <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00270\"><BswMUserCalloutFunction></a> (implementation_specific -);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Function called by the Bsw M when a Bsw MUser Callout is executed.</span></li>\n</ul>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00213\">BswM_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This structure contains all post - build configurable parameters of the BSW Mode</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">enum <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00214\">BswM_ModeType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type identifies the modes that can be requested by Bsw M Users.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_BswM_00216\">BswM_UserType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type identifies a Bsw M User that makes mode requests to the Bsw M.</span></li>\n</ul>",
